WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.047 --> 00:00:14.500
"Someone tried to kidnap Diva," Captain Nova said.

2
00:00:14.501 --> 00:00:18.341
"Oh no!" Ringo gasped.

3
00:00:18.342 --> 00:00:22.371
"Diva has a show tonight," Captain Nova said.

4
00:00:22.372 --> 00:00:26.379
"It's on Concert Planet.

5
00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:29.912
We must get her there safely."

6
00:00:29.913 --> 00:00:32.655
"I'll take her," Lucy said.

7
00:00:32.656 --> 00:00:39.797
"I'm Diva's biggest fan—not Tiny."

8
00:00:39.798 --> 00:00:43.853
"You'll both go," Captain Nova said.

9
00:00:43.854 --> 00:00:47.355
"Hmpf!" Lucy said.

10
00:00:47.356 --> 00:00:53.277
"Do a good job," Captain Nova said.

11
00:00:53.278 --> 00:01:00.957
Ringo and Lucy went to tell Diva.

12
00:01:00.958 --> 00:01:05.700
"What?" Diva blinked.

13
00:01:05.701 --> 00:01:11.031
"You two are taking me to Concert Planet?"

14
00:01:11.032 --> 00:01:16.235
Donny frowned. "You're just rookies!"

15
00:01:16.236 --> 00:01:18.639
"Look," Lucy said.

16
00:01:18.640 --> 00:01:29.728
She showed off her kickboxing skills. "I'm strong!"

17
00:01:29.729 --> 00:01:34.419
"What are you good at?" Diva asked Ringo.

18
00:01:34.420 --> 00:01:40.337
Ringo's face turned red. "I . . . uh . . ."

19
00:01:40.338 --> 00:01:44.902
"Ringo is smart," Bot said.

20
00:01:44.903 --> 00:01:49.400
Donny snorted. "So what?"

21
00:01:49.401 --> 00:01:55.394
He looked at PJ. "Is that robot coming?"

22
00:01:55.395 --> 00:01:58.507
"Yes," Lucy said.

23
00:01:58.508 --> 00:02:01.432
"Good!" Donny said.

24
00:02:01.433 --> 00:02:06.867
"Maybe he can protect Diva!"

25
00:02:06.868 --> 00:02:13.175
Everyone went to the spaceport.

26
00:02:13.176 --> 00:02:16.446
Suddenly Diva stopped.

27
00:02:16.447 --> 00:02:21.703
"I'm so scared!" Diva said.

28
00:02:21.704 --> 00:02:26.701
"What if the kidnapper returns?"

29
00:02:26.702 --> 00:02:30.662
Ringo smiled. "Don't worry, Diva.

30
00:02:30.663 --> 00:02:37.894
I have a smart plan!"

